<title>UK: BOE forecasts 1.4 bln stg shortage, offers help.</title>
<headline>BOE forecasts 1.4 bln stg shortage, offers help.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England offered the UK money market an early round of assistance after forecasting a liquidity shortage of around 1.4 billion stg.</p>
<p>The operations will comprise a repo to September 1, outright offers of bills maturing on or before September 1 and offers of CGO holdings of 8-3/4 percent Treasury loan 1997 at a clean price of 11.01604.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7708</p>
